 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "You are capable of selling",
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 1.566
  },
  {
   "text": "if you can write down five things",
   "start": 1.646,
   "end": 3.011
  },
  {
   "text": "you think people need the most these days.",
   "start": 3.091,
   "end": 4.883
  },
  {
   "text": "Just five.",
   "start": 4.963,
   "end": 5.731
  },
  {
   "text": "Take a moment.",
   "start": 5.811,
   "end": 6.601
  },
  {
   "text": "Number one: Time.",
   "start": 6.951,
   "end": 8.039
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone is drowning in it.",
   "start": 8.119,
   "end": 9.505
  },
  {
   "text": "Tasks, meetings, follow-ups.",
   "start": 9.585,
   "end": 11.143
  },
  {
   "text": "If you can give somebody back",
   "start": 11.223,
   "end": 12.545
  },
  {
   "text": "even an hour a day,",
   "start": 12.625,
   "end": 13.649
  },
  {
   "text": "they will pay you for it.",
   "start": 13.729,
   "end": 14.775
  },
  {
   "text": "Number two: Clarity.",
   "start": 15.125,
   "end": 16.341
  },
  {
   "text": "Most people don't know what to do next.",
   "start": 16.421,
   "end": 18.106
  },
  {
   "text": "They have ten options and zero direction.",
   "start": 18.186,
   "end": 20.106
  },
  {
   "text": "If you can show them the one path forward,",
   "start": 20.186,
   "end": 22.106
  },
  {
   "text": "you've already sold them.",
   "start": 22.186,
   "end": 23.274
  },
  {
   "text": "Number three: Status.",
   "start": 23.624,
   "end": 24.883
  },
  {
   "text": "People want to feel important,",
   "start": 24.963,
   "end": 26.435
  },
  {
   "text": "recognized ahead of their peers.",
   "start": 26.515,
   "end": 28.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Almost every premium product on earth sells this,",
   "start": 28.28,
   "end": 30.371
  },
  {
   "text": "whether it admits it or not.",
   "start": 30.451,
   "end": 31.837
  },
  {
   "text": "Number four: Certainty.",
   "start": 32.187,
   "end": 33.403
  },
  {
   "text": "We live in a world where nothing feels stable.",
   "start": 33.483,
   "end": 35.553
  },
  {
   "text": "The person who can promise an outcome and back it up",
   "start": 35.633,
   "end": 37.979
  },
  {
   "text": "wins every deal",
   "start": 38.059,
   "end": 38.934
  },
  {
   "text": "against someone who can't.",
   "start": 39.014,
   "end": 40.294
  },
  {
   "text": "Number five: Connection.",
   "start": 40.644,
   "end": 41.903
  },
  {
   "text": "People feel more isolated than ever.",
   "start": 41.983,
   "end": 43.775
  },
  {
   "text": "If your product helps them build a community,",
   "start": 43.855,
   "end": 45.753
  },
  {
   "text": "or a relationship, or a team,",
   "start": 45.833,
   "end": 47.497
  },
  {
   "text": "you're selling something they're starving for.",
   "start": 47.577,
   "end": 49.327
  },
  {
   "text": "Now look at your product.",
   "start": 49.677,
   "end": 50.786
  },
  {
   "text": "Which of these five does it actually deliver?",
   "start": 50.866,
   "end": 52.829
  },
  {
   "text": "Because that's not a feature.",
   "start": 52.909,
   "end": 54.402
  },
  {
   "text": "That's the real reason someone will buy from you.",
   "start": 54.482,
   "end": 56.53
  },
  {
   "text": "Sell that.",
   "start": 56.61,
   "end": 57.314
  }
 ]
}